        "tool": "Agent with model set to the profile's agent_tool_model; subagent_type claude/general-purpose for authoring, Explore for read-only search, Plan for design",
        "effort": "The Agent tool has no per-call effort setting. Effort comes from the agent definition or session; record the requested effort and note when it was not enforced.",
        "isolation": "Do not use isolation worktree (needs origin/main, would branch from main). Parallel authors edit disjoint files in the one checkout, do not commit, and the coordinator verifies and commits exact files.",
